{"id": 7101, "result": [{"value": {"choices": []}, "id": "h32mTOWUey", "from_name": "flags", "to_name": "image", "type": "choices", "origin": "prediction"}, {"value": {"choices": ["Minor"]}, "id": "UAuhpRRNge", "from_name": "severity", "to_name": "gpt-output", "type": "choices", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.2, "y": 11.1, "width": 68.7, "height": 14.7, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_1", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.2, "y": 11.1, "width": 68.7, "height": 14.7, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_1", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.2, "y": 11.1, "width": 68.7, "height": 14.7, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Let \ud835\udcd4 = {(X_i, u_i)}_i=1^I, {Y_j}_j=1^J,\u03c9}be an economy with X_i = R_+^L. We say that a household with utility u^*: R_+^L \u2192 R is a Normative Representative Household for economy \ud835\udcd4 if the following statements hold:"]}, "id": "BB_1", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.5, "y": 27.2, "width": 34.9, "height": 4.4, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.5, "y": 27.2, "width": 34.9, "height": 4.4, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.5, "y": 27.2, "width": 34.9, "height": 4.4, "rotation": 0, "text": ["\u2022 If (x', y') Pareto dominates (x, y), then"]}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 40.3, "y": 33.3, "width": 23.6, "height": 12.2, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 40.3, "y": 33.3, "width": 23.6, "height": 12.2, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 40.3, "y": 33.3, "width": 23.6, "height": 12.2, "rotation": 0, "text": ["u^* (\u2211_i=1^I x'_i) > u^* (\u2211_i=1^I x_i)"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.4, "y": 48, "width": 68.1, "height": 19.5, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.4, "y": 48, "width": 68.1, "height": 19.5, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 16.4, "y": 48, "width": 68.1, "height": 19.5, "rotation": 0, "text": ["\u2022 Given a feasible allocation (x, y) and an alternative feasible allocation (x', y') such that u* (\u2211i=1 xi) > u* (\u2211i=1 xi), then there exists an alternative feasible allocation (x\u0304, y\u0304) such that \u2211i=1 x\u0304i = \u2211i=1 x'i, y\u0304j = y'j for all j = 1, 2, ..., J and (x\u0304, y\u0304) Pareto dominates (x, y)."]}, "id": "BB_4", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 68.3, "width": 70.8, "height": 16.7, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 68.3, "width": 70.8, "height": 16.7, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 14.3, "y": 68.3, "width": 70.8, "height": 16.7, "rotation": 0, "text": ["So, a Normative Representative Household is a fictitious household that consumes the aggregate supply of the economy, and has the property that any Pareto optimal allocation must maximize the utility of the Normative Representative Household that consumes the aggregate net supply of the economy at that allocation."]}, "id": "BB_5", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 13.32236842105263, "y": 0.8223684210526315, "width": 35.803865131578945, "height": 3.289473684210527, "rotation": 0}, "id": "L9An1wBpc2", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 13.32236842105263, "y": 0.8223684210526315, "width": 35.803865131578945, "height": 3.289473684210527, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "L9An1wBpc2", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 1920, "original_height": 1080, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 13.322368